 "derivation": "AUTHORED PER-SCENE SEED BOX, construction-derived, T1-free (spec v2.0.0 section 13.15). (1) Reference prefix: one prefix of the scene (cut_roasted_beef s0 = the wave-1 prefix T1 ran on, flame_steak s1, sear_steak s1); the box is authored once and reused for all four prefixes of that scene, as wave 1 reused one box for its four prefixes. (2) Support set: rows of that prefix's cloud whose DEFORMED centre (gaussian_model.get_dynamic_xyz then project_points_to_screen, nearest-pixel test) projects inside the UNDILATED construction silhouette of the scene's build on EVERY training camera (held-out cam00 excluded and never opened) at frame 50 AND at frame 95. (3) Box: the per-axis [1, 99] percentile of the CANONICAL xyz (gaussian_model._xyz, the array realdata_membership_vote.py tests --seed_bbox3d against) of the support set, padded by 0.05 model units on every face, rounded to 4 decimals. (4) No T1 artifact is read at any point.",
